<item>
            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-603] Support Boost 1.53 for Hedwig Cpp Client</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-603</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The latest boost version 1.53 does not compatible with current hedwig-client cpp code for &quot;shared_dynamic_cast&quot; function is moved out of shared_ptr.hpp at this release. Boost 1.52 and before version is ok.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;FYI: &lt;a href=&quot;https://bitbucket.org/osrf/gazebo/issue/581/boost-shared_-_cast-are-deprecated-removed&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://bitbucket.org/osrf/gazebo/issue/581/boost-shared_-_cast-are-deprecated-removed&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
